  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2019 - 2026 Dodge Ram 1500 crew cab new body style (Not Fit Classic)\nFeatures\nPrecise Fit: YITAMOTOR side steps are specifically built for 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Dodge Ram 1500 crew cab new body style (Not Fit Classic); Confirm the product is compatible with your vehicle before purchase\nUnmatched Strength: Crafted from high-strength stainless steel, these side rails are rust and corrosion resistant for stability and long-term durability; Each side supports up to 450lb and offers reliable assistance for all users\nOptimal Width: Our 6-inch wide step bars offer maximum stepping comfort because they feel sturdy and safe but aren't overly wide; The powder coating with glitter prevents rust to enhance your nerf bars' style and appeal\nStylish Design: This running boards have a OE-style polymer circular pattern as well as a slip-resistant plastic step pad that exude style and quality construction\nEasy Installation: Our side steps feature an easy bolt-on installation with no drilling or cutting required; All mounting hardware and instructions are included; Simply mount the brackets under the truck followed by the running boards; Slide the bolts into the proper spot and torque them down to finish\nProfessional installation recommended",
